---

Atlas uses the following third-party libraries, loaded lazily from CDN on first
use. Each is licensed under its own terms:

- DOMPurify (Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0) — HTML sanitization
- jsPDF (MIT) — PDF generation
- docx.js (MIT) — DOCX generation
- pptxgenjs (MIT) — PPTX generation
- JSZip (MIT) — ZIP archive creation
- Marked (MIT) — Markdown parsing (loaded on demand)
- Highlight.js (BSD-3-Clause) — Code syntax highlighting (loaded on demand)
- KaTeX (MIT) — Math rendering (loaded on demand)
- WebLLM (Apache-2.0) — In-browser LLM inference via WebGPU
- Google Fonts (OFL) — Syne, DM Sans, DM Mono

No third-party code is bundled in this repository. Users load these libraries
directly from their respective CDNs at runtime.
